you would have killed us, right?

319
00:26:07,020 --> 00:26:08,760
I'm not so sure about that.

320
00:26:11,640 --> 00:26:14,640
All I know is you should
be grateful to my friends.

321
00:26:26,300 --> 00:26:29,065
You're the one who's
going to reach your limit.

322
00:26:32,740 --> 00:26:33,900
