325
00:26:45,620 --> 00:26:49,340
Overwhelming aggression that
blinds them to everything else.

326
00:26:49,680 --> 00:26:51,300
Like a calamity.

327
00:27:43,140 --> 00:27:47,600
If I'm broken and broken,

328
00:27:48,200 --> 00:27:49,376
I'll be able to die.

329
00:27:50,680 --> 00:27:54,360
I'm not afraid of it.
I'm not afraid of it.

